        "language": "english",
        "review": "I cannot say enough about this game and the developers! They go above and beyond. As a legally blind gamer I realized when I opened it I may not of been able to play it as the text size was too small. I went over to their discord and asked if screen reader would be possible in the future... not even a few days later they came out with an update with screen reader features (that are compatible with the screen reader I already use on mac!) I cannot explain how much this means to me. I finally have a horse game that I am able to play without really straining my remaining vision. They really do care about their players. I cannot thank them enough!!",
